---
description: React component patterns and JSX conventions
globs: **/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---

- Arrow functions only; named export on the component (e.g. `export const Foo = () => {}`). No default exports or imports in `src/components/`.
- JSX props: alphabetical order, callbacks last, shorthand first.
- Self-closing tags for empty elements; no `React.` namespace — use named imports.
- Lucide icons: `XxxxIcon` suffix (`SunIcon`, not `Sun`).
- shadcn/ui components live in `src/components/ui/`; add via `npx shadcn@latest add <name>`.
- Colocate tests (`*.test.tsx`) and stories (`*.stories.tsx`) with components when applicable.
